    "body": "## Overview\n\nInclude `\"finish_reason\": null` in non-final streaming chat completion choices\nfrom the Rust frontend, matching the Python frontend.\n\nRelated to #63656. This PR addresses only the `finish_reason` difference.\n\n## Claims\n\n- Include an explicit null `finish_reason` in non-final choices.\n- Preserve the final finish reason and the `[DONE]` stream terminator.\n- Extend the existing route regression test and document the behavior.\n\n## Validation\n\nThe explicit-null regression assertion failed before the fix:\n`left: None`, `right: Some(Null)`. It passes with the fix.\n\nCommands run from `rust/`:\n\n- `cargo test -p vllm-server stream_without_include_usage_keeps_existing_shape -- --nocapture`\n  — passed.\n- `cargo test -p vllm-server --lib`\n  — 509 passed, 0 failed.\n- `cargo clippy -p vllm-server --all-targets -- -D warnings`\n  — passed.\n- `cargo fmt -p vllm-server`\n  — completed.\n\nApplicable pre-commit checks on the three changed files and\n`git diff --check` also passed.\n\nValidation exercises the HTTP route and SSE serialization using a scripted\nengine. No real-model evaluation was performed.\n\n## Details\n\n`#[serde_with::skip_serializing_none]` omits `finish_reason` when its value is\n`None`. Adding `#[serialize_always]` to this field preserves it as JSON null,\nwhile retaining the existing omission behavior for other optional fields.\n\nThe regression test checks every non-final choice for the presence of\n`finish_reason` with an explicit null value. It also checks the final `\"stop\"`\nreason, absence of usage when not requested, and the `[DONE]` terminator.\n\nOther streaming differences described in #63656 remain outside this PR.\n\nDuplicate-work checks found no matching open PR when searching for #63656\nand related Rust streaming/null/finish_reason changes. #63061 addressed\nnon-streaming responses.\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary> Pull Request Checklist </summary>\n\n- [x] I used vLLM's `/pr-checklist` skill. (Mandatory for agents, optional for humans).\n- [x] AI assistance was used during the creation of this PR.\n\n- [ ] **Design Fit:** Minimizes impact on core components, reuses existing functionality, and justifies added complexity.\n- [ ] **Testing and Validation:** Validates the change and ensures any added tests are meaningful and reliable, with CI coverage or documented CI resource constraints and validation performed outside CI.\n- [ ] **Code Quality and Style:** Keeps code and comments clear and concise, and updates relevant documentation and examples.\n- [ ] **Pull Request Contents:** Includes a brief summary and relevant links, supports claims with evidence, explains root causes and implementation trade-offs, and follows the contributing guide.\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/vllm-project/codesmith/vllm/pr/63739?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3-3x.png\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1795607872&installation_model_id=425286&pr_number=63739&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=vllm-project%2Fvllm&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fvllm-project%2Fvllm%2Fpull%2F63739&signature=a5a1fd99fff34d6a6d894083440ac8f709360598b63aacf9f8ead614609a11e2\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup>Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
